---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Dual Wallet System — Xhavic"
  description="Two execution paths at the sequencer level. Instant Wallet for composable DeFi. Secured Wallet with 24-hour reversal for institutional operations."
>

  <!-- ============================================================
       1. HERO — bg-dark, heading-display, gold accent, flow diagram
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="bg-dark text-white py-24 md:py-36">
    <div class="container max-w-container-lg">
      <!-- Breadcrumb -->
      <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-400 mb-8" data-reveal>
        <a href="/protocol" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Protocol</a>
        <span class="text-gray-600">/</span>
        <span class="text-white font-medium">Dual Wallet System</span>
      </nav>

      <div class="grid-40-60 items-center">
        <!-- Left: Headline block -->
        <div data-reveal>
          <h1 class="heading-display mb-6 gradient-text-static leading-[0.95]">
            Two Execution Paths.<br/>One Network.
          </h1>
          <p class="prose-editorial-dark mb-10 max-w-2xl">
            The Dual Wallet System separates transaction execution at the sequencer level,
            giving every user the choice between instant composability and 24-hour reversibility
            &mdash; within a single chain.
          </p>

          <!-- CTAs -->
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
            <a href="/whitepaper" class="btn-primary">Read the Whitepaper</a>
            <a href="/docs" class="btn bg-white/10 text-white border border-white/15 px-6 py-3 md:px-8 md:py-3.5 hover:bg-white/15 active:scale-[0.98]">
              Developer Integration
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: Hero preview cards -->
        <div class="space-y-5" data-reveal-stagger>
          <!-- Instant card -->
          <div class="card-dark-solid p-6" style="border-color: rgba(34, 98, 255, 0.2);">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
              <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center border border-primary/30">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">Instant Wallet</h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-primary font-semibold">&lt;200ms soft finality</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
              Composable, irreversible, built for DeFi speed. Trades, swaps, and liquidations execute at the pace the market demands.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Secured card -->
          <div class="card-dark-solid p-6" style="border-color: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.2);">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
              <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center border" style="background: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.15); border-color: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.3);">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6" style="color: #c4a35a;" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">Secured Wallet</h3>
                <p class="text-sm font-semibold" style="color: #c4a35a;">24-hour escrow window</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
              Reversible, escrowed, designed for institutional safety. Treasury moves and high-value transfers get the protection they require.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ============================================================
       2. THE PROBLEM — section-compact editorial
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="section-bordered" data-reveal>
    <div class="section-compact container">
      <span class="label-mono">THE PROBLEM</span>
      <h2 class="heading-section text-ink mt-4 mb-8">
        A financial system that treats every<br class="hidden md:block"/> transaction the same is broken.
      </h2>

      <!-- Pull quote -->
      <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-primary pl-6 py-2 my-10">
        <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-ink leading-snug italic">
          "Every existing L2 treats every transaction identically &mdash; same execution pipeline, same finality model, same risk profile."
        </p>
      </blockquote>

      <div class="prose-editorial">
        <p class="mb-4">
          A $50 token swap and a $5 million treasury transfer go through the exact same process.
          They share the same confirmation time, the same reversibility constraints, and the same
          composability model. This forces users to choose between speed and safety &mdash; a false
          choice that no well-designed financial system would impose.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-4">
          These transactions have fundamentally different risk profiles, different stakeholders, and
          different requirements. The architecture should reflect that reality.
        </p>
        <p class="text-primary font-semibold">
          Xhavic solves this with protocol-level transaction risk routing.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ============================================================
       3. HOW IT WORKS — section-bordered, flow diagram
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="section-bordered" data-reveal>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid-40-60 items-start">
        <!-- Left: Explanation -->
        <div>
          <span class="label-mono">MECHANISM</span>
          <h2 class="heading-section text-ink mt-4 mb-6">
            How It Works
          </h2>
          <div class="prose-editorial">
            <p class="mb-4">
              The Dual Wallet System operates at the sequencer level. It is a protocol mechanism,
              not a user interface feature. When a transaction is submitted, the originating wallet
              type determines which execution path the sequencer uses.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-4">
              Instant Wallets route transactions through the fast-finality pipeline &mdash; composable
              with all DeFi protocols, confirmed in under 200 milliseconds, and irreversible by design.
            </p>
            <p>
              Secured Wallets route transactions through the escrow pipeline &mdash; held for 24 hours
              with multi-sig reversal capability, non-composable until finalized, and settled to Ethereum
              only after the escrow window closes.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: CSS Flow Diagram -->
        <div class="flex justify-center">
          <div class="w-full max-w-md">
            <!-- Transaction origin -->
            <div class="flex justify-center mb-6">
              <div class="card-arch px-6 py-3 text-center">
                <p class="text-xs text-muted uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold mb-1">Origin</p>
                <p class="text-base font-bold text-ink">Transaction Submitted</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Connector line down -->
            <div class="flex justify-center mb-6">
              <div class="w-px h-8 bg-gray-200"></div>
            </div>

            <!-- Sequencer box -->
            <div class="flex justify-center mb-6">
              <div class="bg-dark rounded-lg px-8 py-3 text-center border border-white/10">
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold mb-1">Xhavic</p>
                <p class="text-base font-bold text-white">Sequencer</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Branch connector -->
            <div class="relative h-10 mb-6">
              <!-- Vertical stem -->
              <div class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 w-px h-4 bg-ink/20 -translate-x-px"></div>
              <!-- Horizontal bar -->
              <div class="absolute top-4 left-[20%] right-[20%] h-px bg-ink/20"></div>
              <!-- Left drop -->
              <div class="absolute left-[20%] top-4 w-px h-6 bg-primary/60"></div>
              <!-- Right drop -->
              <div class="absolute right-[20%] top-4 w-px h-6" style="background: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.6);"></div>
            </div>

            <!-- Two paths -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
              <!-- Instant path -->
              <div class="rounded-lg border-2 border-primary/30 bg-primary/5 p-4 text-center">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-2">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/>
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <p class="text-sm font-bold text-primary mb-1">Instant Path</p>
                <p class="text-xs text-muted">&lt;200ms finality</p>
                <p class="text-xs text-muted">Composable</p>
                <p class="text-xs text-muted">Irreversible</p>
              </div>

              <!-- Secured path -->
              <div class="rounded-lg border-2 p-4 text-center" style="border-color: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.3); background: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.05);">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-2" style="background: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.2);">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4" style="color: #c4a35a;" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"/>
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <p class="text-sm font-bold" style="color: #c4a35a;">Secured Path</p>
                <p class="text-xs text-muted">24h escrow</p>
                <p class="text-xs text-muted">Non-composable</p>
                <p class="text-xs text-muted">Reversible</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Settlement row -->
            <div class="flex justify-center mt-6">
              <div class="relative h-8 w-full">
                <div class="absolute left-[20%] top-0 w-px h-4 bg-primary/40"></div>
                <div class="absolute right-[20%] top-0 w-px h-4" style="background: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.4);"></div>
                <div class="absolute top-4 left-[20%] right-[20%] h-px bg-ink/15"></div>
                <div class="absolute left-1/2 top-4 w-px h-4 bg-ink/20 -translate-x-px"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-center">
              <div class="card-arch px-6 py-3 text-center">
                <p class="text-xs text-muted uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold mb-1">L1</p>
                <p class="text-sm font-bold text-ink">Ethereum Settlement</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ============================================================
       4. INSTANT WALLET — section-bordered + heading-accent-blue
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="section-bordered" data-reveal>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid-40-60">
        <!-- Left: Content -->
        <div>
          <span class="label-mono">INSTANT WALLET</span>
          <div class="heading-accent-blue mt-4">
            <h2 class="heading-section text-ink">Instant Wallet</h2>
          </div>

          <p class="prose-editorial mt-6 mb-8">
            The Instant Wallet is designed for speed-critical operations where composability
            is non-negotiable. Transactions achieve soft finality in under 200 milliseconds,
            making them immediately available for downstream contract execution.
          </p>

          <ul class="space-y-4">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-ink font-semibold">Full DeFi composability</p>
                <p class="text-muted text-sm">Other contracts can immediately build on transaction outputs.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-ink font-semibold">Irreversible by design</p>
                <p class="text-muted text-sm">Composability requires deterministic finality. No reversal mechanism exists.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-ink font-semibold">Ethereum settlement in ~13 minutes</p>
                <p class="text-muted text-sm">Standard L1 settlement after sequencer confirmation.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-ink font-semibold">Built for DeFi, liquidations, and AI agents</p>
                <p class="text-muted text-sm">Token swaps, perpetual futures, arbitrage, and automated strategies.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: Spec card -->
        <div class="flex justify-center items-center">
          <div class="card-arch w-full max-w-sm" style="border-color: rgba(34, 98, 255, 0.2);">
            <h3 class="label-mono text-primary mb-6">Key Specifications</h3>
            <div class="space-y-5">
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-4 border-b border-gray-100">
                <span class="text-muted text-sm">Soft Finality</span>
                <span class="text-ink font-bold text-lg">&lt;200ms</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-4 border-b border-gray-100">
                <span class="text-muted text-sm">Composable</span>
                <span class="text-primary font-bold">Yes</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-4 border-b border-gray-100">
                <span class="text-muted text-sm">Reversible</span>
                <span class="text-red-500 font-bold">No</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-4 border-b border-gray-100">
                <span class="text-muted text-sm">L1 Settlement</span>
                <span class="text-ink font-bold">~13 min</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                <span class="text-muted text-sm">Security Model</span>
                <span class="text-ink font-bold">Speed-optimized</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ============================================================
       5. SECURED WALLET — section-bordered + heading-accent-gold
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="section-bordered" data-reveal>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid-40-60">
        <!-- Left: Spec card -->
        <div class="flex justify-center items-center">
          <div class="card-arch w-full max-w-sm" style="border-color: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.2);">
            <h3 class="label-mono mb-6" style="color: #c4a35a;">Key Specifications</h3>
            <div class="space-y-5">
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-4 border-b border-gray-100">
                <span class="text-muted text-sm">Escrow Period</span>
                <span class="text-ink font-bold text-lg">24 hours</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-4 border-b border-gray-100">
                <span class="text-muted text-sm">Composable</span>
                <span class="font-bold" style="color: #c4a35a;">No (until final)</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-4 border-b border-gray-100">
                <span class="text-muted text-sm">Reversible</span>
                <span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold">Yes</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-4 border-b border-gray-100">
                <span class="text-muted text-sm">L1 Settlement</span>
                <span class="text-ink font-bold">After escrow</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                <span class="text-muted text-sm">Reversal Method</span>
                <span class="text-ink font-bold">Multi-sig</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: Content -->
        <div>
          <span class="label-mono">SECURED WALLET</span>
          <div class="heading-accent-gold mt-4">
            <h2 class="heading-section text-ink">Secured Wallet</h2>
          </div>

          <p class="prose-editorial mt-6 mb-8">
            The Secured Wallet is designed for high-value operations where reversibility
            is critical. Transactions enter a 24-hour escrow period during which they can
            be reversed via multi-signature or threshold signature authorization.
          </p>

          <ul class="space-y-4">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0" style="background: #c4a35a;"></span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-ink font-semibold">24-hour reversal window</p>
                <p class="text-muted text-sm">Authorized signers can reverse a transaction during the escrow period.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0" style="background: #c4a35a;"></span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-ink font-semibold">Non-composable until finalized</p>
                <p class="text-muted text-sm">Transaction outputs cannot be used by other contracts during escrow.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0" style="background: #c4a35a;"></span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-ink font-semibold">Multi-sig reversal mechanism</p>
                <p class="text-muted text-sm">Threshold signature scheme prevents unilateral reversal actions.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0" style="background: #c4a35a;"></span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-ink font-semibold">Built for treasuries, RWA, and institutions</p>
                <p class="text-muted text-sm">Disbursements, settlements, and cross-chain movements at enterprise scale.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ============================================================
       6. COMPARISON TABLE — section-inset dark, data table
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="section-inset" data-reveal>
    <div class="container max-w-4xl">
      <span class="label-mono-dark">COMPARISON</span>
      <h2 class="heading-section mt-4 mb-4">Side-by-Side Comparison</h2>
      <p class="prose-editorial-dark mb-10">
        Each wallet type serves a distinct operational profile. Here is how they compare.
      </p>

      <!-- Table header -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 mb-3">
        <div class="py-3 px-4">
          <p class="label-mono-dark">Feature</p>
        </div>
        <div class="py-3 px-4 text-center rounded-t-lg bg-primary/10 border-t-2 border-primary">
          <p class="text-sm font-bold text-primary uppercase tracking-wider">Instant Wallet</p>
        </div>
        <div class="py-3 px-4 text-center rounded-t-lg border-t-2" style="background: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.1); border-color: #c4a35a;">
          <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider" style="color: #c4a35a;">Secured Wallet</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Rows -->
      <div class="space-y-2" data-reveal-stagger>
        <!-- Soft Finality -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 items-center">
          <div class="bg-white/5 rounded-lg py-4 px-5">
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Soft Finality</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-primary/10 rounded-lg py-4 px-5 text-center border border-primary/20">
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-primary">&lt;200ms</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-lg py-4 px-5 text-center border" style="background: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.1); border-color: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.2);">
            <p class="text-sm font-bold" style="color: #c4a35a;">24-hour escrow</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Composability -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 items-center">
          <div class="bg-white/5 rounded-lg py-4 px-5">
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Composability</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-primary/10 rounded-lg py-4 px-5 text-center border border-primary/20">
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-primary">Full &mdash; DeFi composable</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-lg py-4 px-5 text-center border" style="background: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.1); border-color: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.2);">
            <p class="text-sm font-bold" style="color: #c4a35a;">None until finalized</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Reversibility -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 items-center">
          <div class="bg-white/5 rounded-lg py-4 px-5">
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Reversibility</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-primary/10 rounded-lg py-4 px-5 text-center border border-primary/20">
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-red-400">Irreversible</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-lg py-4 px-5 text-center border" style="background: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.1); border-color: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.2);">
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-emerald-400">Reversible during window</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Settlement -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 items-center">
          <div class="bg-white/5 rounded-lg py-4 px-5">
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">L1 Settlement</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-primary/10 rounded-lg py-4 px-5 text-center border border-primary/20">
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-white">~13 minutes</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-lg py-4 px-5 text-center border" style="background: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.1); border-color: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.2);">
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-white">After 24h escrow</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Best For -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 items-center">
          <div class="bg-white/5 rounded-lg py-4 px-5">
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Best For</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-primary/10 rounded-lg py-4 px-5 text-center border border-primary/20">
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-white">Trades, swaps, liquidations</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-lg py-4 px-5 text-center border" style="background: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.1); border-color: rgba(196, 163, 90, 0.2);">
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-white">Treasury, RWA, settlements</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="footnote text-center mt-6 text-gray-500">Source: XHAVIC Technical Whitepaper v1.0, Table 4</p>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ============================================================
       7. DEVELOPER INTEGRATION — section-bordered, terminal code
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="section-bordered" data-reveal>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid-40-60">
        <!-- Left: Text -->
        <div>
          <span class="label-mono">INTEGRATION</span>
          <h2 class="heading-section text-ink mt-4 mb-6">
            Developer Integration
          </h2>
          <p class="prose-editorial mb-6">
            The Dual Wallet System exposes RPC endpoints for querying wallet type and escrow status.
            Smart contracts can branch logic based on the originating wallet's execution path.
          </p>
          <p class="text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8">
            Use <code class="text-primary font-mono bg-gray-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">xhv_getWalletType</code> to determine
            whether a transaction originated from an Instant or Secured wallet.
            Use <code class="text-primary font-mono bg-gray-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">xhv_getEscrowStatus</code> to check
            the escrow state of Secured Wallet transactions.
          </p>
